"Il n\u2019y a pas d\u2019examen des demandes pour ce mois : cette vue montre donc ce que vous avez demand\xE9, et non ce qui a avanc\xE9.","\xB7 first in your focus today":"\xB7 priorit\xE9 du jour","No area kept yet":"Aucun domaine conserv\xE9 pour le moment","Month by month":"Mois apr\xE8s mois","What you asked for most, as each owner-goals run saved it. A month closing archives its asks; it doesn\u2019t mean they were done.":"Les demandes que vous avez formul\xE9es le plus souvent, telles qu\u2019elles ont \xE9t\xE9 enregistr\xE9es \xE0 chaque analyse des objectifs du propri\xE9taire. \xC0 la cl\xF4ture d\u2019un mois, les demandes sont archiv\xE9es ; cela ne signifie pas qu\u2019elles ont \xE9t\xE9 r\xE9alis\xE9es.","Areas you finished, and what you asked for in earlier months.":"Les domaines que vous avez termin\xE9s et les demandes formul\xE9es les mois pr\xE9c\xE9dents.","Can\u2019t read your past months right now":"Impossible de lire vos mois pr\xE9c\xE9dents pour le moment","Nothing here yet":"Rien ici pour le moment","claude-mem reads your recent prompts and fills this in automatically.":"claude-mem lit vos demandes r\xE9centes et remplit cette section automatiquement.","owner-goals found it in your prompts":"L\u2019analyse des objectifs du propri\xE9taire l\u2019a rep\xE9r\xE9 dans vos demandes","several Other requests read as steps of it":"plusieurs demandes \xAB Autres \xBB semblent en \xEAtre des \xE9tapes","one request held several separate asks":"une demande contenait plusieurs demandes distinctes","it was set up from how your requests were sorted before":"d\xE9fini \xE0 partir du classement ant\xE9rieur de vos demandes","you wrote it":"vous l\u2019avez r\xE9dig\xE9","{count} placed in it":"{count} class\xE9(s) dans ce domaine","No requests placed in it yet":"Encore aucune demande class\xE9e dans ce domaine"," \xB7 {count} not started":" \xB7 {count} non commenc\xE9(s)",Merge:"Fusionner","Merged into {name}. Its requests show there now.":"Fusionn\xE9 dans {name}. Ses demandes y sont maintenant affich\xE9es.","Kept. It\u2019s in My focus now.":"Conserv\xE9. Ajout\xE9 \xE0 \xAB Mon focus \xBB.","Dismissed. It won\u2019t be suggested again, and its requests are sorted again.":"Ignor\xE9. Ce domaine ne sera plus sugg\xE9r\xE9 et ses demandes seront class\xE9es \xE0 nouveau.","Why it\u2019s suggested: ":"Motif de la suggestion : ","Suggested focus areas":"Domaines prioritaires sugg\xE9r\xE9s","claude-mem suggests areas from your prompts and your requests. Keep the ones you\u2019d ask for things inside of. A refresh never changes an area you decided.":"claude-mem sugg\xE8re des domaines \xE0 partir de vos demandes et de vos prompts. Conservez ceux qui correspondent \xE0 ce que vous demanderiez. Une actualisation ne modifie jamais un domaine que vous avez d\xE9cid\xE9 de garder.","Nothing waiting. New suggestions show up here after the next refresh.":"Rien en attente. Les nouvelles suggestions appara\xEEtront ici apr\xE8s la prochaine actualisation.","asked once":"mentionn\xE9 une fois","asked {times}\xD7":"mentionn\xE9 {times}\xD7","Time not recorded":"Heure non enregistr\xE9e",Close:"Fermer",Loading:"Chargement","Notice: ":"Information : ","Needs attention: ":"\xC0 v\xE9rifier : ","Error: ":"Erreur : ","Not measured yet":"Pas encore mesur\xE9","Discard what you typed?":"Abandonner ce que vous avez saisi ?","Keep editing":"Continuer la modification",Discard:"Abandonner",Breadcrumb:"Fil d\u2019Ariane",More:"Plus","Command palette":"Palette de commandes","Search for a command to run\u2026":"Rechercher une commande \xE0 ex\xE9cuter\u2026","Showing {shown} of {total}":"{shown} sur {total} affich\xE9s","{count} left":"{count} restants","No next step recorded":"Aucune \xE9tape suivante enregistr\xE9e","Agent\u2019s move":"Au tour de l\u2019agent",Terminal:"Terminal","Previous slide":"Diapositive pr\xE9c\xE9dente","Next slide":"Diapositive suivante","Focus overview":"Vue d\u2019ensemble des domaines","Concept illustration"